ir_groups_for_color(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:13:#      非 1 像素做互补映射 2->8、3->7（并保留 1 作为稳定骨架色）。因此位置、尺度、support 完全不变，只改颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:20:#    - 互补映射只使用两对稳定颜色：输入侧 {2,3}，输出侧 {8,7}。颜色变化少而结构清楚，避免无提示的大规模重映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:28:#    - 新 solver 的前提变成：有效 sprite 里的可变颜色必须来自已知互补对；generate_input() 只使用 {2,3}，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:41:#    - 每题只涉及四种前景角色颜色：骨架 1、输入变量色 2/3、输出互补色 8/7。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:42:#    - 两个输入变量色在所有实例中重复出现，并且总是成对地映到固定互补色；少量样例足以归纳映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:52:#    - solver 假设互补映射不会把前景映成背景；generator 的输入变量色固定为 2/3，而互补结果固定为 8/7。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:252:    Recolor every scaled sprite in place using a fixed complementary palette mapping.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:257:    - Every sprite contains color-1 scaffold pixels plus variable-color pixels drawn from a complementary palette pair.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/28/code.py:261:    - Within each sprite, leave background and color 1 alone, and replace every other color by its fixed complement (in this dataset: 2->8 and 3->7).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/25/code.py:55:#      palette color differs from its paired template color. This prevents the fused stamps from collapsing\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/25/code.py:84:#      block, while the bottom swatch color visibly fills the complementary cells. This makes the color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/25/code.py:94:#    - Template colors and their paired palette colors are always different, so each stamped block is a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/10/code.py:613:    strict_groups_a = _expand_strict_pairs(strict_a, color_a, color_b, clean, occupied, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/10/code.py:614:    strict_groups_b = _expand_strict_pairs(strict_b, color_b, color_a, clean, occupied, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:356:    - For each pair, move the entire observed sprite to the partner's anchor position rather than recoloring it in place.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/7/code.py:420:    - For the four-sprite group, pair each sprite with the farthest compatible opposite-type sprite and draw a two-color trail for each pair; for the single A/B pair, draw the direct corridor trail between them.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/7/code.py:423:    - The anchor bbox still solves recognition, scaling, and in-place replacement, but the new visual layer comes from grouping sprites by scale: once the horizontal quartet is identified, D3/0 is the reverse-order pairing and D14/1 is just rendering those long exchanges as explicit colored paths.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/22/code.py:47:#    - 背景孔洞、锚 spine、frame、fill 各自角色稳定，网格看上去像一组规整的“空心徽章”而不是碎片拼贴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/6/code.py:977:    - similar_pairs: how many piece colors have a same-color distractor within shape diff 1..2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/21/code.py:679:        groups[color] = _expand_to_pairs(dents[color], color, other, clean, all_reserved, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/15/code.py:232:    - Group sprites by mirror-family equivalence. Within each matched pair, recolor each sprite's two variable regions using the partner sprite's colors, while keeping its own geometry, scale, anchor, and position.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/15/code.py:236:    - Mirror pairing has to be done on a scale-free, color-normalized representation; once the pair is known, the transformation is local to the original sprite footprint. The final output is \"partner colors inside, self colors on the rim\", not a geometric replacement.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/8/code.py:79:    - The bottom band contains exactly two palette rows with colored pairs. In each template column and on each palette row, one pixel is the template key color and the other is the output color value. The upper pair row encodes block-background color, the lower pair row encodes block-foreground color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/8/code.py:83:    - For each template column, read the two palette rows; within each row, find the pixel matching that template's key color and treat the other pixel in the pair as the encoded repaint color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/8/code.py:86:    Key insight: local marker coordinates still choose where to stamp, but the palette legend must now be decoded as two unordered key-value pairs per template column, yielding a foreground color and a background color for every stamped block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/4/code.py:29:#   2. Sort sprites by occupied area from large to small.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/4/code.py:210:    - Sort sprites by occupied area from large to small, and sort bars from top to bottom.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/4/code.py:213:      paired bar, recolor outer cells to the bar border color and inner cells to the bar\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/5/code.py:777:    groups = _expand_to_pairs(dents, clean, colors, reserved_mask, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/24/code.py:307:    template_colors, dup_pair = _sample_template_colors(k)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/5/code.py:219:        f\"joint match failed for sprite pair {(sprite['edge_color'], sprite['inner_color'])}: \"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/5/code.py:246:    - Match the sprite only to the bar whose (fill, border) pair equals (sprite edge color, sprite inner color).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/2/code.py:32:#       makes the legend's ordered pairs meaningful and avoids a degenerate \"just use unordered colors\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/2/code.py:34:#     - Target pairs use fresh legend-only colors, so the legend is visibly necessary.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/28/code.py:33:#      those cells still need that repaired color internally so dent neighborhoods are judged on the cleaned grid, but the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/28/code.py:551:    groups_a = _expand_to_pairs(dents_a, color_a, color_b, clean, dents_a, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/28/code.py:552:    groups_b = _expand_to_pairs(dents_b, color_b, color_a, clean, dents_b, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/18/code.py:3:# Name: 连接器匹配配合碎片自有通配色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/1/code.py:362:    Decode a tiled stamp legend where marker identity comes from diagonal-pair silhouettes instead of colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/34/code.py:520:    strict_groups_a = _expand_strict_pairs(strict_a, color_a, clean, occupied, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/34/code.py:521:    strict_groups_b = _expand_strict_pairs(strict_b, color_b, clean, occupied, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/13/code.py:71:#      also preserves water by preventing evaporation. Smooth supports show the complementary pattern.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/25/code.py:3:# Name: 边缘互补匹配+锯齿边界+高度不规则形状\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/25/code.py:31:#    complementarity rather than by simple \"this piece already looks like a quadrant\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/25/code.py:369:    - No piece is meant to match a clean quadrant on its own. The decisive cue is the complementary zigzag edge geometry between neighboring pieces, and the final visible seams verify that the assembly is correct.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/9/code.py:282:    - For each matched pair, redraw each source sprite's full logical color pattern at the partner's location, but resize it to the partner slot's scale and align by the color-1 anchor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/9/code.py:284:    Key insight: The pairing source decides which exact color pattern moves, while the target slot decides the final size; nearest-distance matching and target-scale repainting must both be inferred.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/25/code.py:3:# Name: 有序排列大量小碎片行优先拼接\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/14/code.py:331:    - Group each nearby blob pair into one sprite, match its outer color to the bar whose fill has that color, and dock the whole grouped bbox at the same x-position, bottom-aligned.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/7/code.py:47:#    - N is restricted to 4-5 so the 2-3 color template structure and the palette-filled complement are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/7/code.py:92:#    - main() assumes every template has at least one inactive cell so the palette complement exists;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:143:    \"\"\"Fill the pair corridor with the shared color, then overlay the bidirectional path line.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:301:    - For each same-scale pair, fill the corridor between the swapped sprites using the unique non-anchor color shared by both prototypes, then overlay a central two-part path line using the pair's two transfer colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/24/code.py:3:# Name: 碎片打包排列+填充率编码顺序+链式拼接\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/24/code.py:34:#   pair in the hidden assembly shares a colored seam, while non-consecutive contacts are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/22/code.py:209:    local 3x3 neighborhood, but the repair is now a mixed badge whose corner color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/19/code.py:187:      3, and each scale carries its own ordered pair of visible colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:227:SHAPE_COUNT_RANGE = (2, 4)        # 2-3 shapes; each needs a paired target color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:3:# Name: 互补模板OR合并\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:24:#    a two-color partial mosaic. If A, B, and C all mark that slot, the complementary masks fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:34:#      complementary coverage, so the generator switches from dense random sprites to connected\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:46:#    Humans can see the complementary partition directly in the top band, then notice repeated\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:48:#    A full-stack slot yields a fully filled block, making the complementary OR behavior explicit.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:60:    Decode a tiled stamp legend in which several complementary templates may be stacked into the same output block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:64:    - Rows 0..N-1 contain K template masks; together those masks form a complementary partition of one N x N tile.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:74:    - Because the top-band masks are complementary, each active pixel belongs to exactly one template, so the merged\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:79:    share an output slot. The block is not owned by one template anymore; it is the union of every complementary\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:96:    # Read the complementary template partition from the top band.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:144:            assert not np.any(seen & tmasks[j]), \"complementary masks should not overlap\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:167:# -- CFG: complementary partition --\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:205:def _grow_complementary_templates(n: int, k: int) -> list[np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:264:    raise RuntimeError(\"failed to build complementary templates\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:280:    # Missing-one evidence: shows the complementary relationship directly.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:344:        templates = _grow_complementary_templates(n, k)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/17/code.py:353:    # Top band: complementary template masks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/41/code.py:221:    Turn black dents into paired local-and-mirrored color-swap patches.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:20:   - 原题只有 1 个 L 标记和 1 组碎片。solver 的隐式流程是：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:21:     找唯一 marker -> 去掉 marker -> 把全部碎片当成一组 -> 找唯一矩形并装配。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:22:   - 这个融合版固定为 2 个真实目标矩形。每个目标有自己的一组碎片，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:23:     且每组碎片都只含一种强调色 accent，所有组共享同一个 rect_col 边框/通配色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:25:     所有候选 marker 都贴在某块碎片的某个角上，所以局部看起来都像可能的锚点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:27:     找到全部候选 marker -> 去掉 marker 像素后提取所有矩形碎片 ->\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:28:     用碎片里的唯一 accent 先分成两组 ->\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:29:     对每组，收集“缺口落在本组哪块碎片里”的 marker 候选 ->\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:30:     逐个尝试候选，并强制把该候选贴住的碎片预放到最终矩形对应角位 ->\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:31:     只有真候选能成功，假候选会因为那块碎片并不具备该角位要求的两条外框边而失败。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:33:     第一组是红色碎片，第二组是青色碎片。红组里有两个 L，一个贴在真正的左上角块上，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:41:   - 分组线索只使用 2 种 accent 色，每块碎片都恰好只含一种 accent。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:42:     这让分组可见，但仍需先完成分组，不能直接把全体碎片一起装配。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:43:   - marker 颜色与碎片颜色无直接映射。候选归属来自“L 缺口贴着哪块碎片”，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:49:   - 原 main 假设“所有碎片属于同一个总面积”。这里不成立，面积、候选尺寸、回溯装配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:52:     回溯可能绕过它照样拼出某个矩形。新 solver 把“候选缺口贴住的那块碎片”升级成强制锚点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:53:   - 新增假设 1：每个候选 marker 的缺口都落在某块碎片内部，generator 会显式构造并验证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:54:   - 新增假设 2：每块碎片只含一种 accent，generator 的分割逻辑会保证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:60:   - 假 marker 则和对应组里的别的碎片一起做成 piece+marker patch，再随机散放。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:61:   - 其余碎片也随机散放，全部对象之间保持至少 1 格背景间隔；只有 marker 与自己的锚定块允许贴边。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:64:   - 人类能直接看到：有两种碎片家族、每个家族旁边都有两个 L 候选。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:69:   - 候选 marker 只占 3 格，且总是贴在某块碎片外侧，不覆盖碎片内部。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:73:   - 颜色规则只有两层：rect_col 是全局共享边框/通配色；两组碎片各有一种 accent。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:76:     先按碎片家族分两堆，再在每堆里从多个候选 L 里挑出那个能真实充当角块的候选。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:81:   - 碎片提取：从非背景且非 marker-mask 的区域里提取矩形块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:82:   - 分组：每块碎片去掉 rect_col 后应只剩 1 个 accent；按该 accent 分组。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:83:   - 候选归属：看 marker 缺口落在哪块碎片里，再用那块碎片的 accent 把 marker 归到对应组。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/3/code.py:84:   - 组内求解：只允许使用本组碎片；并把候选贴住的那块强制放到该候选声明的矩形角上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/6/code.py:650:    groups_outer = _expand_to_pairs(dents_outer, outer_color, inner_color, clean, all_primary_dents, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/6/code.py:651:    groups_inner = _expand_to_pairs(dents_inner, inner_color, outer_color, clean, all_primary_dents, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/3/code.py:486:        pair = (anchor_color, connector_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:3:# Change: color_match——同色像素配对（s1.color == s2.color），同一颜色的所有像素按极角排序后形成多... → 互补色配对\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:9:#   shape now uses a fixed complementary color pair: (1,8), (2,4), or (3,7).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:12:#   shape alternate between the two paired colors; output fills the connecting\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:28:#      main loop now iterates over complementary families instead.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:51:#   Only three pairings are ever used, and every active shape uses both colors of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:52:#   its pair. The neutral shadow/distractor color never participates in pairing,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:55:#   Each active pair family appears in at most one shape per grid; both colors of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:81:SHAPE_COUNT_RANGE = (2, 4)          # 2-3 complementary-pair shapes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:430:def _pair_coloring(cycle: list[tuple[int, int]], pair: tuple[int, int], start: tuple[int, int]) -> tuple[list[tuple[int, int]], int, int]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/0/code.py:456:    rotated, main_color, partner_color = _pair_coloring(cycle, pair, start)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/30/code.py:815:        int(role_colo