ame-color vertex.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D1/2/code.py:76:#      repeated positive glyph mask, black marks the complement inside each 3x3 tile, and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/24/code.py:49:#    - 每个菱形只绑定一种边框色，避免中心区域出现多色碎片。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/24/code.py:199:    - The outward rays are already present, but they use the paired inner-diamond color instead of the segment color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/24/code.py:350:    color_pairs = _assign_color_pairs(len(placements))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:20:#      - four non-connected marker pairs, each only two same-colored pixels on opposite bbox corners.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:260:    Reconstruct a diagonal-partition square from sparse marker pairs and recolor it from a side-labeled legend.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:277:    The sparse marker pairs do not show the pieces themselves. Their colors tell which side-sector each\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:296:def _pair_patch(shape: tuple[int, int], role: int, color: int) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:308:def _scatter_objects(pair_shapes: dict[int, tuple[int, int]], marker_colors: dict[int, int], legend_map: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:325:        patch = _pair_patch(shape, role, marker_colors[role])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/5/code.py:368:    grid = _scatter_objects(pair_shapes, marker_colors, legend_map)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/20/code.py:3:# Name: 背景色与 rect_col 相同配合碎片零间距\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/20/code.py:97:#        2. exactly one pair of true non-legend pieces shares a body color,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/20/code.py:829:    shared_pair = _pick_shared_color_pair(masks)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/bf45cf4b/D1/0/code.py:20:#     - 生成器进一步限制: 采样瓦片颜色时只从若干互补对里选一侧，因此正常瓦片与反转瓦片的颜色集合完全分离，肉眼容易看出对应关系\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/bf45cf4b/D1/0/code.py:166:        if int(bg) not in pair and int(ctrl_color) not in pair\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/bf45cf4b/D1/0/code.py:169:    chosen_pairs_idx = rng.choice(len(usable_pairs), size=n_tile_colors, replace=False)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/9/code.py:3:# Name: 取消外边框约束配合无锚定碎片\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/13/code.py:19:#    - The generator rejects the original `(bg=0, sep=5)` pair, so the color-variation dimension is always active.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:442:        pair_info[\"pair_edges\"][0]: early_color,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:443:        pair_info[\"pair_edges\"][1]: late_color,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:5:# Name: 颜色互补匹配配合独立分配内部色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:10:# - 原题里，背景上散落若干矩形碎片和一个 3 像素 L-marker；marker 的缺失格给出最终大矩形的一个角。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:12:# - D1/4 把“相同颜色”改成“固定互补颜色”。这里固定互补表\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:14:#   原题不合法，融合版合法，因为每个非 rect_col 位置都互补。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:15:# - D12/1 把“整块矩形共享全局 interior_cols”改成“每块碎片独立分配内部色组合”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:16:#   例如四块可分别主要使用 {0,3}、{9,4}、{0,4}、{9,3}，只在真实接缝上暴露互补关系；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:17:#   因而解题者不能再靠跨碎片延续的大色斑猜配对，只能靠边缘互补证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:19:#   彼此不同，所以全局颜色连续性不再可靠，最终必须依赖互补边匹配来完成拼图。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:22:# - 互补对若过多，人类难以从少量样例归纳；若只有 1 对，又会太弱。这里每个样例固定启用 2 个互补对，共 4 个活动色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:30:# - 原 solver 直接把碎片像素众数当 rect_col。D12/1 下各块可以独立高填充，该前提不再稳健；融合版改为把所有碎片颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:35:#   generator 对每条内部接缝都显式写入 2-3 个互补位置，并保留端点为 rect_col 以避免横纵双重约束冲突。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:36:# - anchor 预放逻辑仍成立，因为 marker 语义、碎片形状、无旋转设定都没有变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:39:# - 生成器先构造目标矩形，再切成规则网格碎片，给每条内部接缝写入互补色，随后在每块内部独立扩展局部色块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:40:# - marker 先放，碎片用 `random_free_location(..., padding=1)` 散开，保证互不重叠、与 marker/其他碎片至少隔 1 格背景。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:44:# - 从 train 样例看，输出中的真实接缝不是“同色延续”，而是稳定互补对反复出现；这能支持人类归纳颜色映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:45:# - 同时，相邻碎片经常拥有不同的局部颜色签名，所以“这两块都有一大片绿色”之类的全局线索被抹掉，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:50:# - 背景、marker、rect_col 外边框、互补接缝、局部内部色块这几类视觉角色分层明确，没有叠在同一位置。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:55:#   1) `complement_seam_cells`：真实邻接边上满足“双方都非 rect_col 且互补且不相等”的位置数，要求足够多；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:56:#   2) `diff_signature_adjacencies`：相邻碎片的非 rect_col 颜色集合不同的邻接条数，要求覆盖大多数邻接。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:60:# - 假设 1：除 bg/marker 外，所有碎片仍是轴对齐矩形且无需旋转。生成器维持原题物理结构。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:61:# - 假设 2：真实 rect_col 是某个实际出现过的碎片颜色。生成器保证外边框统一为 rect_col，因此该候选一定存在。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:62:# - 假设 3：若按正确 rect_col 和互补规则装配，能得到唯一稳定解。生成器通过密集互补接缝和不同局部签名来强化唯一性。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:162:def _solve(grid: np.ndarray, mode: str = \"complement\") -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:357:    return _solve(grid, mode=\"complement\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:506:    complement_seam_cells = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/446ef5d2/10/code.py:521:              