left column first and pour that sequence top-to-bottom into the cavity between the matching neighboring projections, clipping if necessary.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/33/code.py:46:#       solver only needs them for grouping monochrome U-pairs by color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:3:# Change: 输入中交叉处显示'失败者'颜色（碎片度消歧的输者），输出中显示'胜者'颜色... → 输入中交叉处显示背景色（完全隐藏）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:12:#       - 输出中的交叉显示规则仍是“按输入中可见碎片数更多的颜色获胜”；这里的碎片数只统计真正可见的线色块，不把红/黄标记当作线段本体。黄射线若经过交叉则仍强制获胜。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:23:#       - solver 在多色 claim 处看到 g[5,6] 是某条线色，于是直接按碎片数规则决定输出胜者。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:27:#       - solver 在背景格上得到两个 color claims，再按碎片数规则选出输出颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:34:#     - 为避免人类/solver 被颜色 id 的隐式 tie-break 误导，生成器给跨越全部交叉的主线额外放置 2 个红标记，并要求所有非黄射线交叉的胜负在碎片数上严格分出高下。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:38:#     - 原版在 `g[pt] == bg` 的多色重叠分支里使用启发式 `marker_brackets/min(color)`；那依赖“真正交叉通常已有一个失败者颜色可见”，在本变体下不成立，必须改成按碎片度直接判胜。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:39:#     - 黄射线若穿过隐藏交叉，会把“按碎片度判胜”和“按黄射线强制判胜”两种机制叠在同一格，视觉上不整洁。因此生成器禁止黄射线经过任何真实交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/32/code.py:18:- Each consecutive control-color pair still defines one bridge, and bridge color is still the left\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/32/code.py:207:def _best_pair(by_color: dict[int, list[dict]], color_a: int, color_b: int) -> tuple[dict, dict] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/32/code.py:268:        pair = _best_pair(by_color, int(color_a), int(color_b))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/32/code.py:401:    reverse_order = _pair_order_reverse(len(colors))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/32/code.py:403:    ends_order = _pair_order_from_ends(len(colors))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/4/code.py:56:#    - In the input, taller projections always pair with columns containing two colored cells, while\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D11/2/code.py:118:    Repair a one-cell-thick colored line network with red/yellow singleton markers while treating grey cells as mixed-color crossings that hide both participating lines.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D11/2/code.py:132:    Key insight: Grey cells are not choices between two visible colors; they are explicit occlusion markers. The surrounding repaired fragments reveal which color continues straight across horizontally and which color continues straight across vertically, so the solver can rebuild connectivity first and only then repaint the crossing as grey.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/11/code.py:363:        inp_payload, out_payload, meta = _build_multicolor_pairs(rng, order, parent, (\"row\", 0), colors)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/11/code.py:395:        inp_payload, out_payload, meta = _build_multicolor_pairs(rng, order, parent, (\"col\", 0), colors)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/11/code.py:432:        inp_payload, out_payload, meta = _build_multicolor_pairs(rng, order, parent, (\"point\", (0, 0)), colors)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/8/code.py:69:   - The output then replaces those corner pairs with colored hollow rectangles of the same size.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/8/code.py:352:    - For every non-legend diagonal pair of that source color, recover its bounding rectangle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/37/code.py:22:   - D11/2 changes the endpoint cue from \"pick one farthest pair\" to \"same touch color means match\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/37/code.py:31:     local pair. The combo logic groups by color globally and draws A:(0,6)->(5,8), B:(0,3)->(8,4),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/17/co