66:#    - Any optional far-end token is already the exact complementary resting half and never overlaps another source.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/29/code.py:279:    Route full L/T sources through the original wire network, but mirror-split them into complementary halves of the opposite shape family.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/29/code.py:286:    - Every full L source is replaced by a local T-half and emits the complementary T-half to the routed opposite endpoint.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/29/code.py:287:    - Every full T source is replaced by a local L-half and emits the complementary L-half to the routed opposite endpoint.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/12/code.py:442:      corner L traces become filled corner blocks, opposite-side monochrome pairs become filled bands, and dual-color L traces expand into endpoint-anchored checker blocks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/18/code.py:17:#    endpoints. A solid keeps a local remainder and emits a complementary 3x3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:236:    Key insight: The opposite-side touch pair fixes the Z/S geometry, while the component's color layout reveals an `A-B-A` segmentation rather than old alternation or single-elbow behavior.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:8:# - The source task already has a clean notion of \"send one complementary token\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:32:#   fail to materialize its complementary shape, and the painted path length is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:51:# - Original \"far endpoint always receives a complement\" is false. A routed path\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:529:    - Each source token then tries to send its complementary shape along the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:532:    - If the receiving center is free, the complementary shape appears there. If\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:544:    - The old task's routing and shape complement logic still identify what each\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D15/2/code.py:346:    pair_colors = _assign_color_pairs(len(placements))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D15/2/code.py:347:    if pair_colors is None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D15/2/code.py:349:    diamond_colors, border_colors = pair_colors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/15/code.py:179:        color_pair = frozenset((int(rule[\"source_color\"]), int(rule[\"target_color\"])))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/15/code.py:229:      to a validated reciprocal swap. Unpaired legend colors remain ordinary pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/26/code.py:253:    Transform sender tokens locally and route their complementary shape through colored subnetworks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/9/code.py:46:#   assumption: only the intentional U-pair shares a color. The generator\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/9/code.py:582:    - If the next intended L cell is already occupied by an earlier reconstructed path, stop there and recolor that occupied cell to a fixed third collision color. Otherwise paint normally, using a solid color or an alternating pair anchored by the start touchpoint color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D3/1/code.py:31:#     new_rule: Every hole shape is paired with exactly one sprite color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/38/code.py:59:#      the diagonal pair contributes only the source color and a rectangle frame.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/38/code.py:294:    Key insight: The legend pair identifies which color uses which teal rectangle, but the real\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/38/code.py:321:        source_pairs = _