/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:559:def build_endpoints_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:580:def build_comp_checker_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:604:def build_invert0_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:659:def build_sym_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random, idx: int) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:727:def build_training_pair(kind: str, params: dict, n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:730:        return build_fill_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:732:        return build_endpoints_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:734:        return build_comp_checker_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:736:        return build_invert0_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:738:        return build_sym_pair(n, colors, rng, params[\"idx\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:740:        return build_sym_fill_pair(n, colors, rng, params[\"keep0\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:853:    train_src, train_dst = build_training_pair(kind, train_params, train_n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D2/3/code.py:859:    test_src, test_rule_dst = build_training_pair(kind, test_params, test_n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/5/code.py:40:#     - \"D4/4 要求匹配项消失，D12/0 要求未匹配项存在且保留；两者共享同一个 if 分支，正好形成互补而非冲突\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/2/c