1 只能落在外边界”同样失效；现在单格碎片允许落在环内腔体中。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:31:#    - 生成器先把整块环 bbox 预留出来，再把内部填充碎片全部散落到 bbox 外，最后仅把环周边贴回，因此不会有碎片越界进洞。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:32:#    - 输出内腔只由 1 或 2 行高的带状块组成，每块面积最多 6，符合原题碎片尺度，也避免随机散布时难以安放。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:35:#    - 颜色仅作为碎片身份，不依赖颜色编号排序；同一颜色可在多个非相邻带中复用，但位置线索足以支撑观察。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:37:#    - 框架永远是一块大单色对象，碎片永远在框外，输入层次清晰。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:41:#    - 规则可概括为: “先认出完整矩形环，再把外部碎片拼回环内部”，不需要借助任何不可见元数据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:44:#    - 假设环 bbox 内不存在预填充碎片: 通过先封锁 bbox、后贴回环周边来保证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:45:#    - 假设外部碎片恰好能铺满内腔并保持左右对称: 输出先构好，再裁块散布，并用 `main()` 反验。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/10/code.py:47:#    - 对输入检测最大环 bbox，统计其中背景内腔面积 `hole_area` 与 bbox 外碎片面积 `outside_fill_area`。本融合版要求\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D6/0/code.py:18:#    - The new visible control is a pair of marker pixels in color 8 placed on the two\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/14/code.py:3:# Name: 碎片面积均等+无框架\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/21/code.py:3:# Name: 连接器标记匹配+碎片带锚点\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D1/3/code.py:227:        assert target_key not in pairs, \"each target quadrant must have exactly one connector color\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D1/3/code.py:228:        pairs[target_key] = (int(color), bool(hflip), bool(vflip))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D1/3/code.py:231:    return pairs, connector_colors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:457:    pair = tuple(groups[other_colors[0]])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:533:    - Infer the sprite-level rule from the training pair (reflection, fill, endpoint extraction, inversion, checker complement, or symmetry completion).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:537:    - The border palette is no longer decorative. It partitions the four frames into \"training pair\" versus \"test/blank pair\", which is especially important when all non-blank interiors reuse the same visible colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:605:def build_fill_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:624:def build_endpoints_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:645:def build_comp_checker_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:668:def build_invert0_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:722:def build_sym_pair(n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random, idx: int) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:793:def build_training_pair(kind: str, params: dict, n: int, colors: list[int], rng: random.Random):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:795:        return build_fill_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:797:        return build_endpoints_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:799:        return build_comp_checker_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:801:        return build_invert0_pair(n, colors, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:803:        return build_sym_pair(n, colors, rng, params[\"idx\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D18/2/code.py:805:        return build_sym_fill_pair(n, colors, rn