hi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:21:#      - 原 solver 假设所有 T 可同时解释, 这里失效; 需要先完整解析场景, 再按碎片阶段与阶段内顺序执行。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:22:#      - 原 solver 的“小碎片只负责被吸收”假设也失效; 现在小碎片既是可被吸收的对象, 也是阶段排序令牌。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:23:#      - 新 solver 额外假设: 每枚 T 的源区初始颜色恰好出现在某个碎片令牌里, 且令牌颜色互异。生成器会显式保证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:26:#      - 标记之间保留缓冲区, 小碎片与 L9 也不与 T 或彼此重叠、越界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:27:#      - 小碎片放在与其同色源区不同的区域内部, 保证它在输入里是可见的独立对象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:29:#      - 阶段顺序只依赖碎片在画面中的左右位置, 不依赖颜色编号或隐藏排序键。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:33:#      - 输入里只有三类控制元素: T、少量小碎片、可选 L9, 没有额外纹理。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:34:#      - 小碎片数控制在 2-4, T 数控制在 4-5, 并加缓冲, 避免控制物挤成一团。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:36:#      - 颜色变化的线索是结构性的: “碎片颜色 -> 匹配到哪些源区 T -> 按顺序交换”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/18/code.py:38:#        1. 正确规则与忽略碎片顺序的 row-major 交换输出不同;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/c7f57c3e/D12/2/code.py:183:    - The relevant pattern is no longer the unordered pair of colors used by a sprite.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D19/0/code.py:3:# Change: 背景色是网格中最常见的颜色，碎片散布在背景上，输出中背景保持不变... → 背景带有噪声图案\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/8/code.py:750:    for (_src, dst), target in zip(colored_pairs, colored_targets):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/8/code.py:755:        for (s, d), target in zip(colored_pairs, colored_targets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D19/2/code.py:3:# Change: 背景色是网格中最常见的颜色，碎片散布在背景上，输出中背景保持不变... → 背景色与 rect_col 相同\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:38:#         recoloring is determined by the complementary legend topology, not the identical topology.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:48:#       We must convert actual sprite holes into complementary keys before matching.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:55:#     Because all generated sprites stay within actual hole counts 0..3, the solver's complement key stays in-range.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:57:#     Each puzzle contains three distinct legend hole classes and at least one sprite for each complementary class.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:59:#     yields distractors that are erased only under the new complementary lookup.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:69:#     Distractors are generated from actual hole counts whose complementary class is absent from the legend.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:105:    \"\"\"Convert an actual hole count in 0..HOLE_VALUE_MAX into its complementary match key.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:142:    Recolor grey shapes by matching the complement of their hole count to a color legend.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:150:    - For every grey sprite, count its actual holes, convert that count with the 0..3 complement rule `3 - holes`,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:152:    - Recolor the grey sprite to the matching legend color; erase sprites whose complementary key is absent.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:190:LEGEND_COUNT_RANGE = (3, 3)        # keep one complementary class absent so distractors remain visible\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/24/code.py:724:    for (_src, dst), tc in zip(colored_pairs, colored_targets):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/24/code.py:728:        (\"colored\", s, d, tc) for (s, d), tc in zip(colored_pairs, colored_targets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/c7f57c3e/D4/1/code.py:93:    - Each sprite is an integer-scaled copy of one of two prototype frames; the 