ap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/7/code.py:860:        for (s, d), tc in zip(colored_pairs, colored_targets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/0/code.py:54:#     - marker 独立、piece 之间至少隔 1 个 bg 像素，避免与碎片混成一团。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/45a5af55/D11/2/code.py:57:   - With 2-3 pairs, the center color is never the bottom stripe color. This alone distinguishes the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/45a5af55/D11/2/code.py:59:   - Every pair contributes a visible two-layer chunk whose local color order is opposite the input's\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D19/0/code.py:201:    - Delete unreachable decorative wall pixels, then paint the reachable inner boundary using the fill color paired with the nearby structural wall color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:23:      - 原生成器允许一般矩形拼法，单条边可能接多块碎片；在失去纯色外框后，这会让“哪条边应该朝外”过于难判。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:28:      - 原逻辑: 某碎片若放在最上边，则要求 its top edge 全为 rect_col；否则立即剪枝。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:29:      - 新逻辑: 某碎片若放在最上边，则要求 its top edge 在所有其它碎片的 bottom edges 中没有任何兼容对象；反之若它有兼容对边，就不能放到最上边。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:32:    - 仍然只有一个大矩形、一个 L 标记、4-12 个矩形碎片。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:39:      - anchor 预放置依赖“marker 缺口正好对应某块碎片的真实角”；该前提保留。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:45:    - 碎片仍以 padding=1 散落，互不重叠、不越界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D10/0/code.py:49:    - 输入里每块碎片边缘都带有少量彩色“插针”，输出里这些插针不仅出现在内部拼缝，也会出现在最终外轮廓。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D18/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D18 — 碎片切割方式 (meta)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D18/1/code.py:3:# Change: 矩形被切割成网格状（行列划分后可合并相邻格），所有碎片都是矩形且恰好拼成完整矩形... → 重叠切割（碎片有共享像素）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D1/0/code.py:3:# Change: 相邻碎片的接触边上，非 rect_col 像素位置和颜色必须一致；rect_col 充当通配符可匹配任何颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D1/0/code.py:10:#    原题里，两块碎片接触