ive pair, connect the matching squares with a bridge colored\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D4/0/code.py:35:#     bbox is 3x4, then use that source color's legend pair to recolor the placed piece.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D15/1/code.py:26:#   因此完整图案在 180° 旋转后会变成颜色互补版；这让“把哪种颜色当成前景”不再能靠全图计数区分。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D15/1/code.py:32:# - rot180 互补关系在所有样本中重复出现，既能稳定触发 D15，又不会引入多种互相竞争的判定机制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D15/1/code.py:43:# - 与原题不同的是，新图案上下两半存在明显的 180° 互补关系，完整输出也呈现更均衡的前景/背景分布。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D15/1/code.py:129:    Rebuild the full 20x20 balanced motif from a two-color crop of one of its dihedral/complement views.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D15/1/code.py:141:    - The motif is designed so that a 180-degree rotation is exactly its binary complement, so swapping foreground/background may create a second raw match without changing the final colored output.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D10/0/code.py:37:# - Target colors are pairwise distinct and disjoint from source colors, so the new matching stage is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D10/0/code.py:39:# - Sprite masks are also pairwise distinct, so a legend must be read by shape rather than by color id.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D10/0/code.py:47:#   identified as the larger area inside a full rectangle, and the target is the smaller-area complement.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3e6067c3/D1/4/code.py:3:# Change: 控制像素颜色与方块内部填充颜色相同 (s.colors == d.inner_squares.colors)... → 互补色匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D7/3/code.py:22:#        所以 solver 仍需显式排除 legend cells，否则合并碎片时会把 2x1 图例竖条误当成 sprite 附属部分。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a32d8b75/D5/1/code.py:54:#      It is always paired with the same hand geometry, so the color meaning is structurally pinned.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D11/2/code.py:100:    - the complemented windo